Rule 7 (offset must allow a non-empty diagonal for default axes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ 0 - shape(v_1, 0) < v_2 ∧ v_2 < shape(v_1, 1)
>>
Rule 8 (axis1 and axis2 must be within valid range and refer to distinct axes modulo array rank)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= 0 - ndim(v_1) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) ∧ 0 - ndim(v_1) ≤ v_3 ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1) ∧ (v_2 + ndim(v_1)) % ndim(v_1) ≠ (v_3 + ndim(v_1)) % ndim(v_1)
