Rule 9 (offset must allow a non-empty diagonal given explicit axis1 and axis2)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int, v_4 : int} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ v_3 ≥ 0 ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1) ∧ v_4 ≥ 0 ∧ v_4 < ndim(v_1) ∧ v_3 ≠ v_4 ∧ 0 - shape(v_1, v_3) < v_2 ∧ v_2 < shape(v_1, v_4)
